{
  "id": "swap-pair",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Çifti Çevir",
    "en": "Swap the Pair"
  },
  "difficulty": 1,
  "language": "rust",
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "starter": "starter.{lang}.rs",
  "solution": "solution.rs",
  "timeout_sec": 45,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`let (a, b) = pair;` çifti açar.",
      "en": "`let (a, b) = pair;` opens the pair."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```rust\nfn swap<A, B>(pair: (A, B)) -> (B, A) {\n    let (a, b) = pair;\n    (b, a)\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"{:?}\", swap((1, \"one\")));\n}\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```rust\nfn swap<A, B>(pair: (A, B)) -> (B, A) {\n    let (a, b) = pair;\n    (b, a)\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"{:?}\", swap((1, \"one\")));\n}\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "rust_test",
      "tests": [
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(swap((1, \"one\")), (\"one\", 1));",
          "label": {
            "tr": "sayı ve metin",
            "en": "number and text"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(swap((true, 2.5)), (2.5, true));",
          "label": {
            "tr": "başka türler",
            "en": "other types"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(swap((String::from(\"a\"), 1)), (1, String::from(\"a\")));",
          "label": {
            "tr": "String",
            "en": "String"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
